        <note type="unparsed-prose" resp="#machine">2 prose segment(s), 3840 characters not reduced to glosses; nibandha remainder: 7 quotation(s), 8 distinct attribution(s); opens &quot;“kasyāyaṃ vipulaḥ khaṅgo gavye koṣe samarpitaḥ . hematsaruranādhṛṣyo naiṣadhyo bhārasādhanaḥ .. kasya pāñcanakhe koṣe śāyako hemavigrahaḥ . pramāṇarūpasampannaḥ pīta ākāśasannibhaḥ .. kasya hemamaye koṣe suta…&quot;. Full text: the archival profile / source record.</note>
